    },
    {
      "id": "K4BVW5nPLS76ETOeHJjS6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 212.610433826338,
      "y": 712.7416914091411,
      "width": 454.8666687011719,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7JUsvbmcR6GHVt9Iu653t"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b10G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1404688399,
      "version": 186,
      "versionNonce": 828509121,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773219311975,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why only 1 DB?\nF1 telemetry volume is small. Postgres handles this easily. \nLive data becomes historical data after the race ends, \nso a single table with an `is_live` flag is sufficient. \nNo need to split until analytical queries visibly \ncompete with live writes.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why only 1 DB?\nF1 telemetry volume is small. Postgres handles this easily. \nLive data becomes historical data after the race ends, \nso a single table with an `is_live` flag is sufficient. \nNo need to split until analytical queries visibly \ncompete with live writes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yEParOIm-brxhF_xh_QZA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 212.48925289949108,
      "y": 849.5461610839063,
      "width": 290.8666687011719,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7JUsvbmcR6GHVt9Iu653t"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b10V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1427658863,
      "version": 443,
      "versionNonce": 375803087,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773219311975,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When consider splitting the DBs?\nif any queries are locking up the DB, \nas this may affect live writes.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When consider splitting the DBs?\nif any queries are locking up the DB, \nas this may affect live writes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
